    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000364",
    "title": "Matelda and the cloister of Hellfde : extracts from the Book of Matilda of Magdeburg",
    "description": "The public-domain text of Matelda and the cloister of Hellfde : extracts from the Book of Matilda of Magdeburg by of Magdeburg Mechthild, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 32,
    "tags": [
